  "body": "Whangaparaoa, Auckland’s premier coastal location.  Anehana Heights at 455 Whangaparaoa Road is a short distance from the New World and surrounding shops and the, to be completed Pen Link connection to the Northern Motorway.\r\n\r\nThe north facing sections are 538sqm and larger and offer the opportunity for you to and your family to build your dream home, in a family friendly neighbourhood.\r\n\r\nBestowed with magnificent views of the Gulf, these sections offer the astute purchaser the opportunity to secure one or more sites on which to build.\r\n\r\nPhone Graeme Sun\r\nMobile:   021 856 116\r\nEmail:  gsun@neilgroup.co.nz",
